{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turkish Coffee Daily</strong> is a single-player simulation game where you take over a traditional Turkish coffee house left behind by your grandfather. As the player, your mission is to run the place and keep it alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Missions &amp; Daily Tasks:</strong><br>In the game, there are several job types. Take customer orders, serve tea and coffee, prepare drinks on the stove, and deliver them to the right tables.<br>After each successful order, you earn money. You can use this money to buy missing products from the store or buy furniture like tables and chairs from a second store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple areas to explore and interact with. Customers behave differently each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers around 3\u20134 hours of single-player content, depending on how long you take to complete side tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, and enjoy the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403960?t=1765751665","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403960/443886269218039b997580d9aab51feca7fbe097/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765751665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403960/11679d0c6cde2e278f0a14551bfd91eddf8e4c64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765751665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403960/11679d0c6cde2e278f0a14551bfd91eddf8e4c64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765751665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turkish Coffee Daily</strong> is a single-player simulation game where you take over a traditional Turkish coffee house left behind by your grandfather. As the player, your mission is to run the place and keep it alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Missions &amp; Daily Tasks:</strong><br>In the game, there are several job types. Take customer orders, serve tea and coffee, prepare drinks on the stove, and deliver them to the right tables.<br>After each successful order, you earn money. You can use this money to buy missing products from the store or buy furniture like tables and chairs from a second store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple areas to explore and interact with. Customers behave differently each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers around 3\u20134 hours of single-player content, depending on how long you take to complete side tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, and enjoy the game!</p>","developers":["ReaskGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403960/0889a121b1562a467caac4e7995300049f6ba024/header.jpg?t=1765751665","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3403960/848608/19f12468cd5c2d39cf8889b711af5af2ac2ed39e/1750847768/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744578129","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3403960/848608/19f12468cd5c2d39cf8889b711af5af2ac2ed39e/1750847768/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744578129","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3403960/848608/19f12468cd5c2d39cf8889b711af5af2ac2ed39e/1750847768/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744578129","id":257112699,"name":"Turkish Coffee Daily","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571126